## OpenClaw Linux appliance — package seed list (archiso profile).
##
## One package per line; blank lines and lines starting with "#" are ignored
## by mkarchiso. Comments are grouped by purpose.
##
## This is a skeleton seed, not a tested package set: review every group
## against current Arch repos before the first real ISO build (see README.md).
##
## UI note: WebKitGTK (webkit2gtk-4.1) is deliberately NOT listed — it renders
## blank on the reference hardware (docs/verdicts/webkitgtk-on-beelink.md).
## All UI is Chromium app-mode or native GTK/Qt clients.

# --- Base system ---
base
base-devel          # build toolchain for AUR/from-source additions
linux
linux-firmware
sudo
networkmanager      # network control (nmcli/nmtui)
openssh             # remote management of the appliance

# --- Hyprland-family desktop (minimal bar + terminal; matches the beelink reference box) ---
hyprland
waybar              # minimal status bar
foot                # Wayland-native terminal
xorg-xwayland       # X11 fallback for non-Wayland clients
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
polkit              # privilege prompts for desktop apps
wl-clipboard        # Wayland clipboard (needed by Chromium app-mode)
xdg-utils           # xdg-open & friends

# --- UI runtime: Chromium app-mode ---
# The OpenClaw dashboard/pairing UI runs as `chromium --app=...` (see
# provision/install-dashboard-launcher.sh). Do NOT add webkit2gtk-4.1 here.
chromium

# --- OpenClaw gateway runtime ---
git
nodejs
pnpm

# --- Audio / fonts (sensible for a media-capable appliance) ---
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber
noto-fonts

# --- Boot/install plumbing for the installed target (EFI, Intel reference box) ---
grub
efibootmgr
dosfstools
intel-ucode         # reference hardware is Alder Lake-N
